{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1384338-exalted-wrestling-federation","id":1384338,"title":"Exalted Wrestling Federation","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-04-27T19:26:29-07:00","id":1384338,"title":"Exalted Wrestling Federation","content":"Have you ever used wrestling as an inspiration for characters or campaigns?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12378-fma245","name":"FMA245","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"165"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-27T19:46:21-07:00","id":1384339,"title":"","content":"We had a little side campaign once that was basically Exalted WWF. It was 2e and the characters ranged from Solars to Jadeborn so it wasn't even remotely a fair fight most of the time, but it did lead to some fun memorable moments like the jadeborn saying &quot;You think you can beat me? Let me as you a question...do your boots say 'POWA' down the side?&quot; before proceeding to god-kicking-boot his opponent into instant K.O.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1121-drlovemonkey","name":"DrLoveMonkey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1121_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4736"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-27T23:13:14-07:00","id":1384365,"title":"","content":"One of my builds in the Lunar Character Build thread is based on Lucha Libre (and becoming a giant winged serpent, naturally).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8959-prototype00","name":"prototype00","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8959_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"964"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-28T02:19:26-07:00","id":1384387,"title":"","content":"I had a Mongol-esque character who did Mongolian-inspired wrestling, but it wasn't a big part of his character.<br /> <br /> Not WWE wrestling really though. Even though I have a couple of players into it. Maybe I should at some point.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-28T08:30:48-07:00","id":1384412,"title":"","content":"In one game where the ST was doing a lot of &quot;let's have the players round-robin fill out setting details&quot;, we ended up establishing the existence of a wrestling league in the city (it might have been Wu-Jian? Definitely in the west) that was more or less analogous to professional wrestling in that it was both performative art and an athletic competition, complete with heels and faces. The major face was the Crab King, and his nemesis was the heel Simhata Sam. It was the best idea the group ever had, and probably the best idea we ever will.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8026-beans","name":"Beans","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8026_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"472"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-28T09:11:08-07:00","id":1384425,"title":"","content":"Just imagine it:<br /> <br /> A dawn caste solar, champion of justice, donning his hand-stitched leather mask, leaving but room for his mouth, his beard and his eyes - for he is: The Moustache Louchador!<br /> <br /> <br /> Honestly, solar hero style was basically made for wrestling, with all the charms for tossing people around and whatnot. It's a perfect fit.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malfeas F'Tagn - go check out my epic MLP/Exalted crossover &quot;The Scroll of Exalted ponies&quot; @ Fimfiction","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/588-webkilla","name":"webkilla","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar588_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1259"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}